{%- comment -%}
  Favicon strategy (PHAM):
  - Primary icon: android-chrome-192x192.png (>= 48px, square — Google Search requirement).
  - Bundled assets/ are the source of truth (deploy via Shopify CLI).
  - Do not declare sizes="48x48" on a 192px file — crawlers may ignore mismatched tags.
  Google SERP favicon cache can take days–weeks after deploy (Search Console → request indexing).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign pham_icon_192 = 'android-chrome-192x192.png' | asset_url -%}
{%- assign pham_icon_32 = 'favicon-32x32.png' | asset_url -%}
{%- assign pham_icon_16 = 'favicon-16x16.png' | asset_url -%}
{%- assign pham_icon_apple = 'apple-touch-icon.png' | asset_url -%}
{%- assign pham_icon_ico = 'favicon.ico' | asset_url -%}

<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="{{ pham_icon_192 }}">
<link rel="shortcut icon" type="image/x-icon" href="{{ pham_icon_ico }}">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="{{ pham_icon_32 }}">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="{{ pham_icon_16 }}">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="{{ pham_icon_apple }}">
<link rel="icon" href="{{ pham_icon_ico }}" sizes="any">
{%- assign pham_manifest_href = 'site.webmanifest.liquid' | asset_url | replace: '.liquid', '' -%}
<link rel="manifest" href="{{ pham_manifest_href }}">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0A0A0C">
